### Get All Tickets (No Filters)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

### Filter by Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=OPEN

### Filter by Priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?priority=HIGH

### Filter by Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?category=Email

### Get Paged Tickets (Uses defaults: Page 0, Size 5, Newest First)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged

### Get Paged Tickets (Page 0, explicitly sized to 2 items)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=2

### Get Paged Tickets (Page 1, showing the next 2 items)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=2

### Custom Sort: Page 0, oldest tickets first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=asc